1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,080
My father told me: an exam knows no
jokes, and results know no forgiveness.

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,120
Back then, I did not understand.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,040
When the sound cut off, focus began.

4
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,620
But his words never let me go.

5
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:57,180
That day my father smiled and said: the
final chapter does not like jokes.

6
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:03,900
Your chapter begins tonight.
